						"text": "[color=003DA2]Adelaide:[/color]\n\n[color=B4AB90]Yeah, definitely. I feel like it's a really important step in honing my skills. It's much easier to spend time refining one general style than five different ones. That's not to say I want to do the exact same thing over and over and over again, but I do want to find more of a middle ground. Some kind of amalgamation of all those styles.[/color]\n \n[color=8E150B]Alex:[/color]\n\n[color=B4AB90]Are you satisfied with the ways you can share your work, be it on Discord or Instagram or anywhere else? Is sharing work with a community important for feeling like your work is complete?[/color]",
